  "question": "A uniform disc of mass $4$ kg and radius $0.5$ m rolls without slipping on a level floor at $2$ m/s. Find its total kinetic energy in joules.",
  "diagram": "",
  "diagram_alt": "",
  "options": [],
  "answer": "",
  "numerical_answer": "12",
  "tolerance": "0",
  "solution": "$$K = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2\\left(1 + \\frac{k^2}{R^2}\\right) = \\frac{1}{2}(4)(4)\\left(1 + \\frac{1}{2}\\right) = 12\\ \\text{J}$$",
